            "fidelity_note": "The user’s final position abandons the hope for a perfect reputation search or absolute certainty, shifting to a structured risk model. The user adopts several safeguards—such as separating commercial ownership from strategic product commitments and installing a boundary arbitration process—directly into the offer.",
